# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SoftGNSS v3.0 — local-only paths
#
# Patterns are root-anchored ("/...") so they only match at the repository
# root and cannot accidentally swallow files deeper in the tree.
# `git check-ignore -v <path>` reports which rule matched a given file.
#
# NOTE: .gitignore only affects UNTRACKED files. A path that is already
# committed keeps being tracked until it is untracked explicitly:
#     git rm -r --cached <path>
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- AI assistant instructions (kept local) --------------------------------
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md

# --- AI assistant / agent tooling configuration (kept local) ---------------
/.claude/
/.codex/
/.opencode/
/opencode.json

# --- working notes and generated reports (kept local) ----------------------
/docs/

# --- raw IF sample data and pipeline results -------------------------------
# Downloaded sample files (945 MB / 625 MB) and the .mat intermediates the
# pipeline writes: trackingResults.mat, navSolutions.mat, acqresults.mat, ...
/data
*.mat

# --- IDE / editor state ----------------------------------------------------
/.vs/

# --- MATLAB autosave -------------------------------------------------------
*.asv
